    <title>Metayb | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Metayb | 21,193 followers on LinkedIn. We help companies transform seamlessly.
 | Founded in 2022, and headquartered in Chennai, India, Metayb is a technology services and analytics solutions company helping enterprises build, deploy, and accelerate business transformation initiatives at scale. 

We work with forward-thinking organizations across a diverse set of industries such as Consumer Goods, Logistics, Manufacturing, Retail, and Agriculture, and deliver outcome-oriented solutions across Artificial Intelligence, Data and Analytics, Automation, BPM, ERP, IoT, Software/Application Development, Cybersecurity, and Cloud.">

