    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-20T10:22:29.441Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_internationaldayofhappiness-futureofwork-activity-7440704311501881344-oP6z","text":"Happiness at work isn’t a luxury, it’s a driver of performance.\n\nWhen teams operate without friction, they collaborate better, think sharper, and build faster. That’s where real innovation begins.\n\nThis International Day of Happiness, let’s focus on creating environments where people, and ideas, thrive.\n\n#InternationalDayOfHappiness #FutureOfWork #WorkplaceCulture #AI #Leadership #Innovation","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_internationaldayofhappiness-futureofwork-activity-7440704311501881344-oP6z"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-16T06:29:09.292Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_iot-edgeai-artificialintelligence-activity-7439196039166951424-6ZbA","text":"The world of IoT is evolving beyond connectivity.\n\nIn this short conversation, our Delivery Head of IoT, Mr. Narendra P., shares how 2026 marks a pivotal moment for the industry. As IoT enters the era of Agentic Intelligence, the focus is shifting from simply connecting devices to enabling systems that can sense, decide, and act autonomously.\n\nAt Metayb, we are aligning our strategy around three core pillars:\n• Edge-AI integration to enable intelligent decision-making at the source\n• Security-by-Design to meet global compliance and trust standards\n• Outcome-driven solutions that deliver measurable business value like uptime and predictive efficiency\n\nThe infrastructure is ready.\nThe market is expanding.\nThe future of autonomous enterprise is here.\n\n#IoT #EdgeAI #ArtificialIntelligence #DigitalTransformation #AutonomousSystems #TechLeadership #Innovation #FutureOfTechnology #Metayb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_iot-edgeai-artificialintelligence-activity-7439196039166951424-6ZbA"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-13T10:10:50.745Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_employeerecognition-workanniversary-teammetayb-activity-7438164665903403010-sUOh","text":"Celebrating dedication and commitment! 🎉\n\nA big congratulations to Naveen Kumar Thangaraj, Abbinaya N, and Abbinaya N on completing 3 incredible years at Metayb. Their consistent contributions, professionalism, and hard work have played a key role in our journey and success.\nWe’re grateful to have such talented individuals as part of our team and look forward to many more milestones together.\n\n#EmployeeRecognition #WorkAnniversary #TeamMetayb #EmployeeAppreciation #CompanyCulture #TeamSuccess #WorkplaceExcellence #MilestoneCelebration #PeopleFirst","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_employeerecognition-workanniversary-teammetayb-activity-7438164665903403010-sUOh"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-10T09:19:37.502Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_metayb-mpl2026-championsriseagain-activity-7437064612161667074-AncC","text":"Champions rise again. 🏆\n\nWith India lifting the T20 World Cup 2026, the spirit of cricket is stronger than ever. Now the excitement moves from the international stage to our very own battlefield MPL 2026.\n\nFrom world champions to workplace champions, the game continues. It’s time for teams to bring their strategy, teamwork, and winning mindset to the pitch.\n\nWho will lift the MPL 2026 Cup?\n\nLet the games begin.\n\n#Metayb #MPL2026 #ChampionsRiseAgain #CorporateCricket #TeamSpirit #WorkplaceCulture #OfficeChampions #CricketFever #WinningMindset #Teamwork #Leadership","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_metayb-mpl2026-championsriseagain-activity-7437064612161667074-AncC"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-07T19:41:54.150Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_womeninleadership-inclusionmatters-activity-7436134049833836545-5Aex","text":"Diverse leadership teams outperform. On International Women’s Day, we recognize the women contributing to innovation, analytics, and digital transformation. #WomenInLeadership #InclusionMatters","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_womeninleadership-inclusionmatters-activity-7436134049833836545-5Aex"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-04T07:34:54.162Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_this-holi-lets-color-the-future-with-ai-powered-activity-7434863930725945345-wsVC","text":"This Holi, let’s color the future with AI-powered insights and data-driven growth.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_this-holi-lets-color-the-future-with-ai-powered-activity-7434863930725945345-wsVC"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-03-03T06:52:51.980Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_aiimpactsummit-enterpriseai-leadership-activity-7434490964255105024-xaPG","text":"Our Founder & CEO Mr. Amit Todi and Director of Tech Mr. Varun Selvan attended the India AI Impact Summit 2026, where global leaders, policymakers, and technology pioneers came together to discuss the next phase of AI.\nFrom governance frameworks to enterprise-scale deployment, one theme stood out:\n\nAI adoption will belong to companies that build responsibly, scale intelligently, and align technology with real business outcomes.\nIndia is clearly positioning itself as a serious AI ecosystem, not just in innovation, but in impact.\n\nAt Metayb, we remain focused on translating AI conversations into measurable transformation for enterprises.\nExcited about the momentum ahead.\n\n#AIImpactSummit #EnterpriseAI #Leadership #DigitalTransformation #MetaYB #AIIndia","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_aiimpactsummit-enterpriseai-leadership-activity-7434490964255105024-xaPG"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-02-19T07:01:14.906Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_data-alone-isnt-enough-impact-comes-from-activity-7430144419103727616-Nl0s","text":"Data alone isn’t enough. Impact comes from understanding people, problems, and possibilities. That’s how we approach every solution at Metayb.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_data-alone-isnt-enough-impact-comes-from-activity-7430144419103727616-Nl0s"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-02-17T09:19:36.348Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_wishing-everyone-a-month-filled-with-reflection-activity-7429454462164881408-Kt1Z","text":"Wishing everyone a month filled with reflection, gratitude, and renewed purpose.\nRamadan Mubarak.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_wishing-everyone-a-month-filled-with-reflection-activity-7429454462164881408-Kt1Z"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb"},"datePublished":"2026-02-14T05:00:44.727Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_metayb-leadership-brandbuilding-activity-7428302154253111296--jF9","text":"Swipe right only when the chemistry (and clarity) is right.\nBecause great partnerships aren’t random, they’re aligned.\n\n#Metayb #Leadership #BrandBuilding #StrategicPartnerships #BusinessGrowth #WorkCulture #Innovation #CorporateCreativity #ContentStrategy\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/metayb_metayb-leadership-brandbuilding-activity-7428302154253111296--jF9"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Metayb","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/metayb","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"ALG Towers 3rd floor, Plot no. 48, Industrial Estate main road, Electrical and Electronic industrial estate","addressLocality":"Chennai","addressRegion":"Tamil Nadu","postalCode":"600096","addressCountry":"IN"},"description":"Founded in 2022, and headquartered in Chennai, India, Metayb is a technology services and analytics solutions company helping enterprises build, deploy, and accelerate business transformation initiatives at scale. \n\nWe work with forward-thinking organizations across a diverse set of industries such as Consumer Goods, Logistics, Manufacturing, Retail, and Agriculture, and deliver outcome-oriented solutions across Artificial Intelligence, Data and Analytics, Automation, BPM, ERP, IoT, Software/Application Development, Cybersecurity, and Cloud.\n","numberOfEmployees":{"value":384,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHpQjpLN9MeSQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1711542459800/metayb_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=9xbDsrIkS1Ts5dXlqkEpyJPc12PBBybgdvvwDPIpK5I","description":"Metayb","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"We help companies transform seamlessly.\n","sameAs":"https://metayb.ai/"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
